            "input": {
              "text": "TTLCache"
            },
            "output": "{\"matches\":[{\"line\":14,\"offset\":1382,\"path\":\".github/copilot-instructions.md\",\"sha256\":\"e4add063e2e396238b6da21c0fc7812d13c6acec6e7c091f6d432843da694f47\",\"text\":\"- Caches happen to be picklable (`test_pickle`, `test_pickle_maxsize`; `_Timer.__reduce__` and `TTLCache.__setstate__` rebuild time-tracking state), but **pickling is neither officially supported nor documented**. The pickle format is an implementation det\"},{\"line\":21,\"offset\":2271,\"path\":\".github/copilot-instructions.md\",\"sha256\":\"e4add063e2e396238b6da21c0fc7812d13c6acec6e7c091f6d432843da694f47\",\"text\":\"- `TTLCache`/`TLRUCache`: Time-based eviction via `_TimedCache` base; `_Timer` context manager freezes time during operations to prevent TOCTOU bugs (re-entrant via `__nesting`, proxies the wrapped timer through `__getattr__`); `expire()` returns `list[tup\"},{\"line\":29,\"offset\":3930,\"path\":\".github/copilot-instructions.md\",\"sha256\":\"e4add063e2e396238b6da21c0fc7812d13c6acec6e7c091f6d432843da694f47\",\"text\":\"- `func.py`: `functools.lru_cache`-compatible wrappers; all use `threading.Condition()` by default for thread safety + stampede prevention; `_UnboundTTLCache` extends `TTLCache` with `math.inf` maxsize for `maxsize=None`\"},{\"line\":27,\"offset\":1658,\"path\":\".github/copilot-review.md\",\"sha256\":\"880c4d764be5c3e52e6c4975d5afaa4b6568f20f63e3ad86368329d51b6cca2c\",\"text\":\"| 4 | Info | `_Timer.__reduce__`, `TTLCache.__setstate__`, `CacheTestMixin.test_pickle*` | Caches are picklable and the behavior is unit-tested, but pickling is **not** an officially supported or documented feature. The pickled state is raw instance `__dic\"},{\"line\":51,\"offset\":3739,\"path\":\".github/copilot-review.md\",\"sha256\":\"880c4d764be5c3e52e6c4975d5afaa4b6568f20f63e3ad86368329d51b6cca2c\",\"text\":\"all decorators, providing stampede prevention by default. `_UnboundTTLCache`\"},{\"line\":52,\"offset\":3816,\"path\":\".github/copilot-review.md\",\"sha256\":\"880c4d764be5c3e52e6c4975d5afaa4b6568f20f63e3ad86368329d51b6cca2c\",\"text\":\"cleanly extends `TTLCache` with `math.inf` maxsize for the\"},{\"line\":292,\"offset\":5919,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- ``TTLCache.expire()`` returns iterable of expired ``(key, value)``\"},{\"line\":381,\"offset\":7508,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"  ``from cachetools.ttl import TTLCache``\"},{\"line\":385,\"offset\":7579,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"  ``from cachetools import TTLCache``\"},{\"line\":398,\"offset\":8001,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Change exact time of expiration in ``TTLCache`` (breaking change).\"},{\"line\":400,\"offset\":8071,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"  ``TTLCache`` items now get expired if their expiration time is less\"},{\"line\":404,\"offset\":8349,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"  also implies that a ``TTLCache`` with ``ttl=0`` can no longer hold\"},{\"line\":428,\"offset\":8876,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Add documentation and tests for using ``TTLCache`` with\"},{\"line\":566,\"offset\":11498,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Reimplement ``LRUCache`` and ``TTLCache`` using\"},{\"line\":570,\"offset\":11654,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Fix ``TTLCache`` not calling ``__missing__()`` of derived classes.\"},{\"line\":575,\"offset\":11819,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Improve how ``TTLCache`` handles expired items.\"},{\"line\":586,\"offset\":12081,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Clean up ``LRUCache`` and ``TTLCache`` implementations.\"},{\"line\":592,\"offset\":12182,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Refactor ``LRUCache`` and ``TTLCache`` implementations.  Note that\"},{\"line\":609,\"offset\":12509,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Fix pickling of large ``LRUCache`` and ``TTLCache`` instances.\"},{\"line\":680,\"offset\":13838,\"path\":\"CHANGELOG.rst\",\"sha256\":\"f29f61e485d5e34678cef0cae28fa2256caa81fff0013cb982fa3f40e4f5de4e\",\"text\":\"- Use a ``NestedTimer`` for ``TTLCache``.\"}],\"omitted_matches\":41,\"unreadable_files\":0}",
